Z||000000||Lady Pegasus||12-06-2001||06:11 PM||||I've always wondered....for as long as I can remeber, I have always believed in "mythological creatures."  I belive that unicorns and dragons and faeries have and do exist.  Maybe it's just the dreamer in me, but I love that idea.  I would love nothing better than to have a unicorn.  I used to collect them, and I still have a good collection stored away until I get my own place.  And I fell in love with "Dragonheart."  Who wouldn't want a dragon for a friend, ESPECIALLY when it has a voice like Sean Connery.  Where do I sign up?  And I especially loved the game "Dragon Seed."  You could create your own dragons and compete them.  My ex liked it 'cause it was finally a game that we could play together that didn't suck a$$.  Heehee.  And faeries are such beautiful creatures...I just hope that they aren't like the faeries in "Labyrinth."  I wish I could live in a mythical world.  &lt;Sigh&gt;  (Who could tell by my FORUM NAME!!)  Oh well.  Til fate allows our fair paths to cross again, fare thee well, lords and ladies.<P>------------------<BR>Hey pretty....don't you wanna take a ride with me...through my world?||||reg||5
